<title>GERMANY: BHW sees issue vol over 1 bln dm for share listing.</title>
<headline>BHW sees issue vol over 1 bln dm for share listing.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>German savings bank BHW Holding AG said on Thursday it expected an issue volume of well over one billion marks for its bourse listing.</p>
<p>The bank, a potential candidate for a blue chip DAX listing, planned to put 30 percent of its 900 million marks in equity on the market, and expected a capital increase of about 135 million marks, chief executive Reinhard Wagner told journalists on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150</p>
